                    <span class="shaper-specialty">Longboard</span>
                    <span class="shaper-portrait-name">Sosa</span>
                </div>
                <div class="shaper-info">
                    <p class="shaper-origin">🇦🇷 Miramar, Argentina</p>
                    <p class="shaper-name">Pablo Sosa</p>
                    <p class="shaper-years">22 años de experiencia</p>
                    <p class="shaper-bio">El maestro del longboard clásico. Pablo combina técnicas tradicionales hawaianas con madera autóctona argentina para resultados únicos.</p>
                    <div class="shaper-stats">
                        <div class="sstat"><div class="sstat-num">250+</div><div class="sstat-label">Tablas</div></div>
                        <div class="sstat"><div class="sstat-num">22</div><div class="sstat-label">Años</div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="shaper-styles">
                        <span class="style-tag">Longboard</span>
                        <span class="style-tag">Noserider</span>
                        <span class="style-tag">Classic</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="shaper-cta">
                        <a href="#" class="cta-link" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); openModal('sosa')">Ver perfil <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg></a>
